    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529-a1">

                <pb facs="0732" n="658" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg658"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <p rendition="#center">“<hi rendition="#italic">El Peruano Extraordinario.</hi>”</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of Foreign Relations,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Lima,</hi><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 14,
                    1866.</p>
                <p>I, Mariano Ignacio Prado, provisional supreme head of the republic, decree:</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Only Article.</hi> The treaty of alliance, offensive
                    and defensive, concluded in this city the 5th December, 1865, by the respective
                    plenipotentiaries of the republics of Peru and Chili, is approved, and, in
                    consequence, let the exchange of ratifications have place.</p>
                <p>The secretary of state for the department of foreign relations is charged with
                    the execution of this decree.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">Given at the government house in
                            <placeName>Lima</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1866-01-12">the 12th January, 1866</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MARIANO I. PRADO.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. Pacheco.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
